   __all__ = ["EventBus", "EventHandler"]
   ```

6. **Initialize in main.py lifespan**
   ```python
   # In lifespan context manager
   mediator = Mediator()
   event_bus = EventBus(max_history=100)

   # Wire to FastAPI state
   app.state.mediator = mediator
   app.state.event_bus = event_bus
   ```

