- [ ] Setup GitHub Secrets (DEPLOY_*)
- [ ] Enable GHCR permissions
- [ ] Test with a push to master
- [ ] Verify health check passes

## Success Criteria

- [ ] Workflow triggers on push to master
- [ ] Image builds and pushes successfully
